        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    Note over Admin,PostgreSQL: CU-03 - Gestionar Usuarios\n    participant Admin as Administrador (sysadmin)\n    participant Vue as Vue Frontend (Admin/Users/Index.vue)\n    participant Controller as UserController\n    participant PostgreSQL\n\n    Admin-&gt;&gt;Vue: 1. GET /admin/users\n    Vue-&gt;&gt;Controller: 2. GET /admin/users\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;PostgreSQL: 3. Consultar usuarios + roles + areas\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;Controller: 4. Calcular metricas\n    Controller--&gt;&gt;Vue: 5. Renderizar tabla + metricas\n    Admin-&gt;&gt;Vue: 6. Ver listado\n    opt Filtrar o eliminar\n        Admin-&gt;&gt;Vue: 7. Filtrar por nombre/rol\n        Vue-&gt;&gt;Controller: 8. GET /admin/users?search=...\n        Controller--&gt;&gt;Vue: 9. Resultados filtrados\n    end\n    opt Eliminar usuario\n        Admin-&gt;&gt;Vue: 10. Click eliminar\n        Vue-&gt;&gt;Controller: 11. DELETE /admin/users/{id}\n        Controller-&gt;&gt;PostgreSQL: 12. Soft-delete (is_active=false)\n        Controller--&gt;&gt;Vue: 13. Tabla actualizada\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="cu03-seq">
